Similarly, in step (5), the 3D spherical embedding of the intersection points of the local X-axis vectors on the unit spherical surface is carried out using the method proposed by Wilson et al.26, where the angles φij computed in step (4) are used as initial values and ωij as the weights. The resulting embedding with Euler angles \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
